From: Mirko Brombin <9479903+mirkobrombin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 17:26:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] uapi: freeze the MTS v0.2 descriptor and tier contract

Give userspace one versioned contract before the observe-mode collector
starts producing data. The descriptor remains one atomic 64-bit word. Tier
capabilities, normalized histogram bounds, and provider-loss semantics are
explicit and append-only through v0.3.

Document mts.conf as a portable configuration contract. systemd may
generate the boot unit, but it does not become the policy controller.
Non-systemd implementations consume the same file.

Signed-off-by: Mirko Brombin <9479903+mirkobrombin@users.noreply.github.com>
---
